=== Parity with web source (data / composition / states / i18n) ===
  data sources: useSettings (saved mode + ai_cost_cap_cents), useSaveAiSettings (save mutation),
                useAiUsageToday (cost_micro_cents) -> all bound via the AiSettingsSource P1/S8 seam (no HTTP in view).
  composition : HelixIconBox + title 'Helix' + subtitle; 'Helix mode' radiogroup (Off(default)/Local-only/Cloud +
                hints); off banner; cloud cost-cap spend bar ('Today's Helix spend', '$spent / $cap', fill, warn/
                critical hints); primary Save button ('Save Helix settings' / 'Saving…').
  states      : loading / empty / error (+retry) / data + connection axis (live/stale/offline chip+banner, one-shot
                stale auto-refresh) + off-banner + cost-cap ok/warn/critical + saving. Every state has a #Preview.
  i18n        : 23 keys in AISettings.strings (table 'AISettings'); all web 'ai.settings.*' keys preserved verbatim;
                no English literals in Swift (facade NSLocalizedString(key, value: fallback)).
  a11y        : VoiceOver labels on icon box (hidden), mode rows (.isButton/.isSelected + hint), refresh, cost-cap
                progress (label+value), header .isHeader; Dynamic Type via tokens; Reduce Motion via TSFadeIn/TSSkeleton.
  telemetry   : AiSettingsModel.start() emits P1/S11 'view.opened' surface='AISettings' once (asserted in tests).

